ons</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>Skin Consultation with Dermatologist</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>1 Session</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>Package Duration: 4–6 Weeks  |  Starting Price: ?8,999</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>Total: 15 Sessions</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>This package is recommended for brides with relatively clear skin who simply want to add a healthy, polished glow and improve their skin texture before the big day. It can be started 4 to 6 weeks before the wedding.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<h3>SILVER PACKAGE</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The Smart Choice — Targeted Treatments for Real Results</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Silver package is a significant step up from the previous one. It is designed for brides who are struggling with mild skin concerns such as pigmentation, uneven skin tone, dry and dehydrated skin, and dullness. The package includes one clinical treatment and a range of bridal facial packages. It is neither too light nor too clinical, just right for a bride who is new to skincare and wants to get the best results without overdoing it.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n <tbody>\r\n  <tr>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>Treatment Included</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>No. of Sessions</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>Advanced Bridal Facial (Vitamin C + Peptide Infusion)</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>5 Sessions</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>Chemical Peel (Mild — Glycolic / Lactic)</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>2 Sessions</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>Microdermabrasion (Face + Neck)</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>2 Sessions</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>Full Body De-Tan Treatment</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>3 Sessions</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>Full Body Polishing (Herbal / Coffee Scrub)</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>2 Sessions</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>Underarm & Bikini Lightening</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>2 Sessions</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>Lip Pigmentation Treatment</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>2 Sessions</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>Eyebrow Shaping + Upper Lip + Chin Threading</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>3 Sessions</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>Personalised Skincare Routine Consultation</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>1 Session</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>Package Duration: 6–8 Weeks  |  Starting Price: ?14,999</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>Total: 22 Sessions</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Silver package is our most popular choice among working brides who have a defined timeline and want visible results without committing to a long-term programme. It begins 6 to 8 weeks before your wedding and delivers a noticeably brighter, smoother, and more even complexion.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<h3>GOLD PACKAGE</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The Complete Transformation — For Brides Who Want It All</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Gold package is where the magic really happens. It is a 3-month program that includes everything a bride needs to get rid of skin concerns such as acne, pigmentation, uneven skin tone, tanning, hair removal, and dullness. It is a package that includes the best of our clinical treatments and bridal rituals, giving the bride a transformative experience from head to toe.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n <tbody>\r\n  <tr>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>Treatment Included</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>Sessions (Pre-Bridal)</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>Sessions (Bridal)</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>Luxury Bridal Facial (Collagen Boost + Hydra Infusion)</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>6</p>\r\n 