(454, 'are-acne-marks-permanent', 'Are Acne Marks Permanent?', 'Acne are troublesome. Coming on good terms with these pimples is a rare thing. If you are feeling sad about a tiny breakout on your special day,', '<p>Acne are troublesome. Coming on good terms with these pimples is a rare thing. If you are feeling sad about a tiny breakout on your special day, then you must know it is quite common and has happened with most of us.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Acne occurs due to clogged pores and excess secretion of sebum. It takes 3-4 days to resolve on its own. The aftermath of acne is the scars that are left behind. Post acne marks can be distressing. These scars fade away at a much slower rate and cause an uneven texture of the skin.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>What causes these acne scars?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Inflammatory Acne: Acne due to hormonal imbalances like <a href=\"https://www.skinfinityderma.com/skin-and-hair-in-pcos/\">PCOS </a>or thyroidism develops as cystic or nodular growth, deep-seated in the skin tissue. This acne leaves a scar that often appears reddish in color.</li>\r\n <li>Untreated CysticAcne: The untreated acnes penetrate deeper into tissue and cause scarring.</li>\r\n <li>Excess touching or popping-out acnes: Touching your face transfers bacteria from your hands to face, thereby clogging pores and resulting in breakouts. These breakouts can be itchy, and some people tend to squeeze them. Squeezing out increases the size of the wound and pushes the contents of acne into adjoining tissue.</li>\r\n <li>Poor hygiene: Hygiene is important because bacteria that cause acne multiplies in an unhygienic environment. Pillowcases and wipe cloth are the two most common places for bacteria to adhere and grow.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>What are the types of Acne Scars?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Normal fine-line Scar: Appears as line and fades out quickly if appropriately treated.</li>\r\n <li>Hypertrophic Scar: Raised above the skin and appear as a small lump of healing tissue.</li>\r\n <li>Atrophic scar: These scars are deep-seated on the surface of the skin, giving it an uneven texture.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Post Inflammatory Hyperpigmentation:</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>A healed acne lesion appears as a brown patch. This PIH resolves with topical application of medication and adequate sun protection. This pigmentation is more prone in people with a habit of squeezing out acne.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Where can I get the best treatment?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Skinfinity is the answer if you are looking for<a href=\"https://www.skinfinityderma.com/acne-pimple-treatment-noida/\"><strong> acne scar treatment in Noida</strong></a>. With a wide range of treatment options, a dermatologist can suggest the right one for your skin type. It is essential to work on the root cause of acne. A combination of therapies works best in the removal of acne scars for good.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Chemical Peels: <a href=\"https://www.skinfinityderma.com/chemical-peel/\">Chemical peels</a></strong> are an excellent option for a start. These peels consist of mild acids which gently remove the outermost layer of skin and produce newer skin in 5-7 days. These peels are absolutely safe and painless. They also reduce the appearance of fine wrinkles, dead skin, and pigmentation. Regular sittings, as advised by dermatologist, promote glowing skin with reduced appearance of scars.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Derma-roller: </strong>It is best suited for mild to moderate scarring. These rollers induce pricking on the skin and induce the synthesis of collagen to improve over all texture of the skin and reduce the visibility of the scar tissue. It is not advised on wheatish or darker skin tones as it causes PIH (Post-inflammatory hyperpigmentation).</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Laser treatment for acne scars: </strong>Undoubtedly, the most popular<strong> <a href=\"https://www.skinfinityderma.com/acne-pimple-treatment-noida/\">treatment for acne scars</a></strong>. Laser treatments work best on active acne or acne scars. Fraxel DUO laser is the cutting-edge technology for skin resurfacing and reducing the appearance of scar tissue in 6-7 sessions. It can be used on any type of scarred tissue. It is also effective in combating the effects of sun damage, photoaging, pigmentation, uneven skin tone, uneven texture, and stretch marks.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Microdermabrasion: </strong>It effectively removes the shallow scars which appear as small pits on your skin surface. This procedure is ideally suited for the removal of teenage scars.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Collagen Therapy:</strong> Adjunction of collagen therapy with any above-mentioned procedures improves the elasticity of the skin. It also enhances the effectiveness of treatment procedures and diminishes the appearance of scar tissue.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Acne scars are not going to resolve overnight. You need to see an expert which can tell most suitable treatment for you. Skinfinity has a team of highly trained and knowledgeable doctors who can help you get your glowing skin back. Our clinic is the best place for <strong>Acne Scar Treatment In Noida</strong>. or consult a <a href=\"https://www.skinfinityderma.com/dermatologist-in-gurgaon/\"><strong>dermatologist in gurgaon</strong> </a>and get complete treatment following proper protocol. Be ready to say goodbye to those stubborn acne scars.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Seeking expert skin care? Choose <strong>Skinfinity Derma Clinic</strong> for the top <strong>dermatologist in Gurgaon</strong> or <strong>dermatologist in Noida</strong>:<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://share.google/QWnBOKzMe7Ay6jqFh\" target=\"_new\">Gurgaon</a> |  <a href=\"https://share.google/QDMZRhFL4Bh0etsEe\" target=\"_new\">Noida</a></p>\r\n', 'https://www.skinfinityderma.com/assets/blog/5a50f6e63331fec449901d0d50d90273.jpg', 'Are Acne Marks Permanent?', 'Are Acne Marks Permanent? Causes, Types & Treatments', 'Wondering if acne marks are permanent? Learn the difference between acne marks and scars, how long they last, and the most effective dermatologist treatments to fade them.', 'Acne scar treatment in Noida', 'https://www.skinfinityderma.com/are-acne-marks-permanent/', 'Dr. Ipshita Johri', NULL, '[\"Are Acne Marks Permanent?\"]', 0, 1, '2021-11-22 04:30:00', '2026-11-01 16:56:51', '2026-11-01 18:18:24'),
(456, 'common-skincare-myths-debunked', 'Common Skincare Myths Debunked', 'The skin is the body\'s most expansive organ, but few people know how to take care of their skin properly. Between media hype and amateur beauty tips, it is hard to differentiate between myths and reality', '<p>The skin is the body&#39;s most expansive organ, but few people know how to take care of their skin properly. Between media hype and amateur beauty tips, it is hard to differentiate between myths and reality. For example, should we splurge on an expensive moisturizer or not? Here&#39;s the truth behind six common beauty myths.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>1. Sunscreen is needed only when one is outdoors on a sunny day.</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Sunscreen should be applied every day whether indoors or outdoors. It is a misconception that we are safe from the sun&#39;s UV rays when we&#39;re indoors. However, UV rays are of two types. While the UVB rays that cause sunburn are blocked by walls, we are still vulnerable to the UVA rays indoors. UVA rays are responsible for<strong> skin aging and skin cancer</strong>. Similarly, on cloudy days, we are safe from UVB rays but still need protection from UVA rays. Ideally, the sunscreen should have a minimum SPF of 20-30. If someone doesn&#39;t like having to layer makeup over sunscreen, pick makeup products that are enriched with SPF.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>2. One needs to moisturize and tone the skin every day.</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>No two people have the same skin requirements. While it may work for a person with dry skin to moisturize their skin every day, this may be detrimental for someone with oily skin. If you have oily skin, look for a lotion instead of creams. For someone with dry skin, cream-based moisturizer is better. Similarly, a toner is great for oily skin but can disturb the Ph balance of dry skin. Also, take a look at the climate before moisturizing the skin. Moisturizing the face regularly in a humid area can lead to breakouts while using a toner in dry weather can make the skin rough.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3. Makeup causes acne.</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Makeup aficionados can breathe a sigh of relief; wearing makeup for extended durations does not lead to acne. The way we use makeup and the type of products we use are the villains here. Contrary to popular belief, the foundation is designed not to be absorbed into skin pores but to form a layer over the skin. Using expired products is also one of the main <a href=\"https://www.skinfinityderma.com/acne-pimple-treatment-noida/\"><strong>causes of acne</strong></a>. The other reason makeup is thought to trigger acne is that if one sleeps with makeup on, they may wake up with a breakout. This is because not washing the face, clogs the skin pores with the day&#39;s grime and dirt.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4. The laser is harmful to the skin.</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>There are plenty of myths associated with laser treatments. Often there are claims like laser exposes the patient to radiation, it can cause cancer, it can cause burns, it can cause skin thinning, they are expensive, etc. But these are all just the myths and do not have any relevance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5. Salons are the best place for getting facial.</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Not all salons are apt to provide facial treatments as per the individual skin needs. One must consult an expert dermatologist to know the needs of the skin before going for any facial treatment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>6. The anti-wrinkle injection is only for film stars.</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>It is a common belief that anti-wrinkle injection is just for film stars as they have to look young as long as possible. But it is not true. Anyone can have Anti wrinkle injection as it helps in keeping away the signs of premature aging and wrinkles. Several people are recommended anti-wrinkle injections in their twenties and thirties just to ensure beautiful and radiant skin. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Consult with <a href=\"https://www.skinfinityderma.com/dermatologist-in-gurgaon/\"><strong>Best Skin Specialist in Gurgaon </strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Related Skin Treatments We Offer</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Enhance your skin’s health and beauty with our specialized dermatology services in <strong>Noida</strong>, tailored to address your unique concerns:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>\r\n <p><a href=\"https://www.skinfinityderma.com/dark-circle-treatment/\"><strong>Dark Circles Treatment</strong></a> – Reduce under-eye pigmentation, puffiness, and tired appearance.</p>\r\n </li>\r\n <li>\r\n <p><a href=\"https://www.skinfinityderma.com/acne-pimple-treatment-noida/\"><strong>Acne Scar Treatment</strong></a> – Fade scars, smooth skin texture, and boost confidence.</p>\r\n </li>\r\n <li>\r\n <p><a href=\"https://www.skinfinityderma.com/chemical-peel/\"><strong>Chemical Peel</strong></a> – Exfoliate, brighten, and rejuvenate your skin naturally.</p>\r\n </li>\r\n <li>\r\n <p><a href=\"https://www.skinfinityderma.com/laser/\"><strong>Laser Skin Resurfacing</strong></a> – Improve skin tone, texture, and reduce fine lines.</p>\r\n </li>\r\n <li>\r\n <p><a href=\"https://www.skinfinityderma.com/anti-aging/\"><strong>Anti-Aging Treatment</strong></a> – Minimize wrinkles and restore youthful elasticity.</p>\r\n </li>\r\n <li>\r\n <p><a href=\"https://www.skinfinityderma.com/skin-lightening-and-pigmentation/\"><strong>Pigmentation Treatment</strong></a> – Even out skin tone and fade dark spots.</p>\r\n </li>\r\n <li>\r\n <p><a href=\"https://www.skinfinityderma.com/botox-treatment-gurgaon/\"><strong>Botox Treatment</strong></a> – Smooth dynamic wrinkles for a fresher, younger look.</p>\r\n </li>\r\n <li>\r\n <p><strong><a href=\"https://www.skinfinityderma.com/freckles-and-lentigens/\">Freckles Treatment</a> </strong>– Effectively fade freckles with advanced solutions like laser therapy and chemical peels for a clearer complexion.</p>\r\n </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.skinfinityderma.com/book-appointment/\"><strong>Book your consultation today</strong></a> and let our experts help you achieve healthy, radiant skin.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Your skin deserves the best — consult our:<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://share.google/QWnBOKzMe7Ay6jqFh\" target=\"_new\">Dermatologist in Gurgaon</a> |  <a href=\"https://share.google/QDMZRhFL4Bh0etsEe\" target=\"_new\">Dermatologist in Noida</a></p>\r\n', 'https://www.skinfinityderma.com/assets/blog/9841522a3c676416fcfe1de257242a4c.jpg', 'Common Skincare Myths Debunked', 'Common Skincare Myths Debunked', 'The skin is the body\'s most expansive organ, but few people know how to take care of their skin properly.', 'Common Skincare Myths Debunked', 'https://www.skinfinityderma.com/common-skincare-myths-debunked/', 'Dr. Ipshita Johri', NULL, '[\"Common Skincare Myths Debunked\"]', 0, 1, '2019-10-06 04:30:00', '2026-11-01 16:56:51', '2026-11-01 18:18:24'),
(457, 'skin-and-hair-in-pcos', 'PCOS and Your Skin & Hair: Causes, Symptoms, and Expert Solutions', 'PCOS or Polycystic Ovary Syndrome is a hormonal problem in women of reproductive age. Women suffering from this problem may experience hormonal fluctuation.', '<p>PCOS, or<strong> Polycystic Ovary Syndrome</strong>, is a common hormonal disorder affecting women of reproductive age. Women with PCOS often experience hormonal fluctuations that can impact their overall health, especially their <strong>skin and hair.</strong> While some women may have regular menstrual cycles, they can still suffer from noticeable <strong>skin and hair problems in PCOS.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>In PCOS, the ovaries develop multiple small fluid-filled cysts, which prevent regular ovulation and lead to hormonal imbalance. Treatment for PCOS mainly focuses on managing symptoms and adopting lifestyle modifications.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Common Symptoms of PCOS</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Women with <strong>Polycystic Ovary Syndrome</strong> may experience a variety of symptoms, including:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>\r\n <p>Irregular periods or missed periods</p>\r\n </li>\r\n <li>\r\n <p>Excess hair growth (hirsutism)</p>\r\n </li>\r\n <li>\r\n <p>Severe acne</p>\r\n </li>\r\n <li>\r\n <p>Weight gain</p>\r\n </li>\r\n <li>\r\n <p>Infertility</p>\r\n </li>\r\n <li>\r\n <p>Thinning hair or hair loss</p>\r\n </li>\r\n <li>\r\n <p>Skin pigmentation issues</p>\r\n </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Skin and hair changes are among the most distressing symptoms of PCOS. Consulting the <strong>best skin doctor in Gurgaon </strong>can help manage these concerns effectively. The main aim of treatment is to balance hormones and address visible symptoms to improve confidence and quality of life.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Skin and Hair Problems in PCOS</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Due to elevated levels of male hormones (androgens), many young women with <strong>PCOS </strong>notice increased facial and body hair, also called hirsutism. Hair thinning, especially on the crown (similar to male pattern baldness), is also common.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Other common <strong>skin problems in PCOS</strong> include:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>\r\n <p>Persistent acne</p>\r\n </li>\r\n <li>\r\n <p>Dark patches on the neck, underarms, or groin (acanthosis nigricans)</p>\r\n </li>\r\n <li>\r\n <p>Skin tags around the neck and armpits</p>\r\n </li>\r\n <li>\r\n <p>Pigmentation and dullness on the face</p>\r\n </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Women may also experience unwanted hair growth on the chest, back, and other body areas, along with frequent breakouts that can affect self-esteem.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Treatment for PCOS</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Managing PCOS skin and hair issues starts with addressing the underlying hormonal imbalance. Treatment options include:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>\r\n <p>Medications: Hormonal therapies such as birth control pills, patches, or vaginal rings help regulate menstrual cycles, reduce testosterone levels, and improve acne and excess hair growth.</p>\r\n </li>\r\n <li>\r\n <p>Diet and lifestyle changes: Weight loss and a balanced diet can greatly improve PCOS symptoms.</p>\r\n </li>\r\n <li>\r\n <p>Surgical options: In severe cases, surgical interventions may be considered.</p>\r\n </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Before starting any medication or treatment, it is crucial to consult a qualified doctor to determine the best approach for your individual condition.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Treatments for Skin and Hair Conditions in PCOS</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>When it comes to <strong>skin and hair treatments for PCOS</strong>, holistic and personalized approaches work best. According to<strong> Dr. Ipshita Johri, over 60\% of her patients have successfully managed PCOS skin and hair issues</strong> through customized diet and lifestyle changes, without relying solely on hormonal pills.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>\r\n <p>Excess hair growth: Advanced laser hair removal techniques using US FDA-approved IPL, ND YAG, and diode lasers tailored to each skin type.</p>\r\n </li>\r\n <li>\r\n <p><a href=\"https://www.skinfinityderma.com/hair-fall-treatment/\">Hair thinning and hair loss</a>: Treatments like hair mesotherapy and scalp rejuvenation therapy promote hair growth and reduce thinning.</p>\r\n </li>\r\n <li>\r\n <p><a href=\"https://www.skinfinityderma.com/acne-pimple-treatment-noida/\">Acne and pigmentation:</a> Chemical peels and laser therapies help clear acne, reduce pigmentation, and improve overall skin texture.</p>\r\n </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Combining lifestyle modifications, dermatologist-guided skincare, supplements, and advanced aesthetic treatments can help you achieve flawless skin and healthy hair, even with PCOS.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Final Thoughts</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>PCOS and skin and hair problems often go hand-in-hand, but with proper medical guidance and consistent lifestyle changes, these issues can be effectively managed. If you’re struggling with acne, pigmentation, unwanted hair, or hair loss due to , don’t hesitate to consult the best skin doctor in Gurgaon for a personalized treatment plan.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> Need help managing PCOS-related skin and hair issues? Book a consultation today and start your journey toward clearer skin and stronger hair!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Need professional skin care from a <strong>dermatologist in Gurgaon</strong> or <strong>Noida</strong>? Visit us today:<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://share.google/QWnBOKzMe7Ay6jqFh\" target=\"_new\">Gurgaon Location</a> | <a href=\"https://share.google/QDMZRhFL4Bh0etsEe\" target=\"_new\">Noida Location</a></p>\r\n', 'https://www.skinfinityderma.com/assets/blog/3ca1f0eadb45e4a38616a049c929db40.jpg', 'Skin and Hair in PCOS', 'Skin and Hair in PCOS', 'PCOS or Polycystic Ovary Syndrome is a hormonal problem in women of reproductive age. Women suffering from this problem may experience hormonal fluctuation.', 'Skin and Hair in PCOS', 'https://www.skinfinityderma.com/skin-and-hair-in-pcos/', 'Dr. Ipshita Johri', NULL, '[\"Skin and Hair in PCOS\"]', 0, 1, '2019-10-03 04:30:00', '2026-11-01 16:56:51', '2026-11-01 18:18:24'),
(458, 'tips-for-scalp', 'Tips  For Scalp', 'Our dermatologists recommend following these practices to keep the scalp clean and healthy', '<p>Our dermatologists recommend following these practices to keep the scalp clean and healthy-</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Wash hair on every alternate day, from root to tip.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. Use a hair oil 1 hour before shampoo.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. Use a conditioner if hair is frizzy.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>4. Don&#39;t rub the hair vigorously, always gently pat dry.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If there’s dandruff even after these practices, one must<a href=\"https://g.co/kgs/cEjhnsa\"><strong> consult a dermatologist</strong></a>. The doctor will check if it is normal (seasonal) dandruff or seborrheic dermatitis or psoriasis of scalp. After proper diagnosis, accordingly medication is suggested.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>TIPS FOR OILY FACE</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Following are some of the best tips our skin specialists recommend to control the oil production on the face.  <br>\r\n<em>Dont</em><em>’s</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Avoid tetra packs of milk and dairy products</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. Avoid oily and deep fried food</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. Avoid moisturising base and oily foundations</p>\r\n\r\n<p>4. Avoid lotion and cream-based products</p>\r\n\r\n<p>5. Don’t scrub the face too much to take off the oil, one will end up damaging the skin more</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<em>Do</em><em>’s</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Use a glycolic/salicylic acid 1–2\% cleanser as face wash</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. Use a gel-based moisturiser</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. Wash face with cold plain water as many times as possible in a day</p>\r\n\r\n<p>4. Visit a dermatologist to get a dose of vitamin-A derivative medicine and retinol peels to control oil gland secretion, blackheads, whiteheads and pimples.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>5. Use a dry-touch broad spectrum sunscreen advised by the dermatologist after proper skin examination.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>consult a <a href=\"https://www.skinfinityderma.com/dermatologist-in-gurgaon/\"><strong>dermatologist in gurgaon</strong> </a>and get complete treatment following proper protocol.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Searching for an expert <strong>dermatologist in Gurgaon</strong> or a reliable <strong>dermatologist in Noida</strong>? We’re here to help:<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://share.google/QWnBOKzMe7Ay6jqFh\" target=\"_new\">Gurgaon Clinic</a> |  <a href=\"https://share.google/QDMZRhFL4Bh0etsEe\" target=\"_new\">Noida Clinic</a></p>\r\n', 'https://www.skinfinityderma.com/assets/blog/b468a9a9cd63fcbc00a92bac014848e5.jpg', 'Tips  For Scalp', 'Tips  For Scalp', 'Our dermatologists recommend following these practices to keep the scalp clean and healthy.', 'Tips  For Scalp', 'https://www.skinfinityderma.com/tips-for-scalp/', 'Dr. Ipshita Johri', NULL, '[\"Tips  For Scalp\"]', 0, 1, '2019-09-04 04:30:00', '2026-11-01 16:56:51', '2026-11-01 18:18:24'),
(459, 'beauty-beyond-skins', 'Acne : Pimple made Simple !', 'Both males and females suffer from acne. Acne means a condition when you have blackheads, white heads', '<p>Both males and females suffer from acne.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Acne means a condition when you have blackheads, white heads ( small white bumps on skin giving uneven look ), pimples that may eventually lead to pus filled painful large pimples that leave marks and scars on face.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Why does Acne occur?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>It can occur due to improper diet, hormonal fluctuations, using inappropriate cosmetic products and sticky creams, humidity, sweating and dead skin collection causing blocked pores or due to some medicines.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>How can i get a permanent solution for acne and get a clean glowing face ?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Its your over all diet and exercise routine, with proper sleep and water intake, under guidance of a <strong><a href=\"https://www.skinfinityderma.com/dermatologist-in-gurgaon/\">skin doctor in gurgaon</a></strong>  that will help you get a permanent solution for acne. There are 3 steps of <a href=\"https://www.skinfinityderma.com/acne-pimple-treatment-noida/\"><strong>acne treatments</strong></a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>First to stop and heal the acne, then to take care of the marks and spots, and lastly to get rid of scars to get a smooth skin. A combination treatment is required including oral medicines, vitamins and antioxidants, creams and sunscreen, chemical peels, medical facials, resurfacing and rejuvenating lasers and Skin Rejuvenation. 6-8 months are required for complete recovery.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Tips to prevent and deal with acne :</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Do not touch, press or rub the pimples.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Do not use hair products, creams and cosmetics without doctor’s advice.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Always remove your make up before going to bed.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Use non sticky sunscreen that suits your skin.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Use mild pH balanced cleansers for your face.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Apply ice on painful pimples, it will help in reducing pain and redness. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you have acne, consult a <a href=\"https://www.skinfinityderma.com/dermatologist-in-gurgaon/\"><strong>dermatologist in gurgaon</strong> </a>and get complete treatment following proper protocol.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Looking for the <a href=\"https://share.google/XVYmfGPHqMi0nS2FD\">best dermatologist in Gurgaon</a> or a trusted dermatologist in Noida?<br>\r\n<strong>Visit our clinics:</strong><br>\r\n<a href=\"https://share.google/QWnBOKzMe7Ay6jqFh\">Dermatologist clinic Gurgaon</a><br>\r\n<a href=\"https://share.google/QDMZRhFL4Bh0etsEe\">Dermatologist clinic Noida</a></p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Related Skin Treatments We Offer</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Discover our expert treatments designed to target specific skin concerns and enhance your natural beauty:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>\r\n <p><a href=\"https://www.skinfinityderma.com/dark-circle-treatment/\">Dark Circles Treatment</a> – Reduce under-eye pigmentation, puffiness, and tired appearance.</p>\r\n </li>\r\n <li>\r\n <p><a href=\"https://www.skinfinityderma.com/acne-pimple-treatment-noida/\">Acne Scar Treatment</a> – Fade scars, smooth skin texture, and boost confidence.</p>\r\n </li>\r\n <li>\r\n <p><a href=\"https://www.skinfinityderma.com/chemical-peel/\">Chemical Peel</a> – Exfoliate, brighten, and rejuvenate your skin naturally.</p>\r\n </li>\r\n <li>\r\n <p><a href=\"https://www.skinfinityderma.com/laser/\">Laser Skin Resurfacing</a> – Improve tone, texture, and reduce fine lines.</p>\r\n </li>\r\n <li>\r\n <p><a href=\"https://www.skinfinityderma.com/anti-aging/\">Anti-Aging Treatment</a> – Minimize wrinkles and restore youthful elasticity.</p>\r\n </li>\r\n <li>\r\n <p><a href=\"https://www.skinfinityderma.com/skin-lightening-and-pigmentation/\">Pigmentation Treatment</a> – Even skin tone and fade dark spots.</p>\r\n </li>\r\n <li>\r\n <p><a href=\"https://www.skinfinityderma.com/botox-treatment-gurgaon/\">Botox Treatment</a> – Smooth dynamic wrinkles for a fresher look.</p>\r\n </li>\r\n <li>\r\n <p><a href=\"https://www.skinfinityderma.com/freckles-and-lentigens/\">Freckles Treatment </a>– Fade freckles effectively with advanced treatments like lasers and peels, tailored to your skin for a clearer, even tone.</p>\r\n </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p><em><a href=\"https://www.skinfinityderma.com/book-appointment/\">Book your consultation</a> today and find the right treatment for your skin.</em></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<p><em>Disclaimer:<br>\r\nThe content shared in this blog is for educational and awareness purposes only. It should not be considered a substitute for professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. Always consult a qualified dermatologist or healthcare provider for personalised guidance regarding your skin concerns.</em></p>\r\n', 'https://www.skinfinityderma.com/assets/blog/46449afbfe2eeda5361be76eb6632aab.jpg', 'Skin & Hair Care', 'Acne : Pimple made Simple !', 'Acne means a condition when you have blackheads, white heads ( small white bumps on skin giving uneven look ), pimples that may eventually lead to pus filled painful large pimples that leave marks and scars on face.', 'Acne Treatment ,', 'https://www.skinfinityderma.com/beauty-beyond-skins/', 'bhumika', NULL, '[]', 0, 1, '2017-05-02 04:30:00', '2026-11-01 16:56:51', '2026-11-01 18:18:24');
