(4, 2, 'Procapil 3\% + Redensyl 3\% Scalp Hair Density Serum', '1 ml (using dropper)', 'Once daily at night', '90 Days', 'Massage gently into crown and hairline with fingertips until absorbed', '2026-11-05 18:17:00'),
