(69, 'acne-pimple-treatment', 'acne-pimple-treatment', '[\"acne-pimple-treatment\"]', 'Acne & Pimple Treatment', 13, 'Face & Neck', '[\"US-FDA APPROVED\",\"DOCTOR SUPERVISED\",\"0\% EMI\"]', 4.92, 315, '45 mins', 3499, 5000, '30\% OFF', 6, 583, '1 Clinical Session', '[\"US-FDA approved clinical protocol tailored by senior MD dermatologists.\",\"Zero downtime or minimal recovery with long-lasting aesthetic outcomes.\",\"Safe for Indian skin tones with personalized pre-and-post care guidance.\"]', 'Doctor-Supervised Clinical Excellence by Dr. Ipshita Johri', 'Acne & Pimple Treatment performed by board-certified senior dermatologists at Skinfinity Derma clinics in Noida and Gurgaon. Customized clinical protocols with US-FDA approved technology.', '<p>Experience visible, clinically-proven transformation with our doctor-led Acne &amp; Pimple Treatment. Under the expert supervision of Dr. Ipshita Johri, our specialized medical dermatology protocol targets root causes with customized clinical energy, active serums, and strict sterilization standards. Ideal for patients seeking safe, radiant, and long-lasting results.</p>', '/uploads/01-problem-1793553079661-5471.jpg', '[{\"src\":\"/uploads/01-problem-1793553079661-5471.jpg\",\"caption\":\"01-problem\"},{\"src\":\"/uploads/02-consultation-1793553084401-8097.jpg\",\"caption\":\"02-consultation\"},{\"src\":\"/uploads/03-procedure-1793553089031-9955.jpg\",\"caption\":\"03-procedure\"},{\"src\":\"/uploads/04-result-1793553093719-5345.jpg\",\"caption\":\"04-result\"}]', '[{\"title\":\"Clinical Skin & Health Analysis\",\"description\":\"<p>Digital dermoscopy and doctor consultation to evaluate tissue depth and indications.</p>\",\"image\":\"/images/treatments/banner-acne.webp\"},{\"title\":\"Targeted Cleansing & Prep\",\"description\":\"<p>Sterile pre-treatment medical prep and application of numbing cream if indicated.</p>\",\"image\":\"/images/treatments/banner-acne.webp\"},{\"title\":\"Precision Clinical Protocol\",\"descripti