 is virtually painless.</p>\"},{\"question\":\"Why choose Skinfinity Derma for Acne & Pimple Treatment?\",\"answer\":\"<p>At Skinfinity Derma, every single protocol is planned and supervised by certified MD dermatologists using genuine US-FDA approved technology and hospital-grade sanitization.</p>\"}]', 'Acne & Pimple Treatment in Noida & Gurgaon | Skinfinity Derma', 'Book Acne & Pimple Treatment with Dr. Ipshita Johri at Skinfinity Derma. US-FDA approved technologies, top dermatologists, and customized aesthetic results.', NULL, '/images/treatments/banner-acne.webp', 1, 1, 1, '2026-11-01 12:38:35', '2026-11-01 17:11:37', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BdJ7l2v26e0', 'Acne & Pimple Treatment | Skinfinity Derma Clinic', 'https://img.youtube.com/vi/BdJ7l2v26e0/hqdefault.jpg', NULL, '/uploads/02-consultation-1793553084401-8097.jpg', '/uploads/03-procedure-1793553089031-9955.jpg', '/uploads/04-result-1793553093719-5345.jpg', 'https://www.skinfinityderma.com/treatments/acne-pimple-treatment', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
