e\":\"/images/offers/bridal-package.webp\"},{\"stepNumber\":\"05\",\"title\":\"Doctor Review & Home Care Plan\",\"desc\":\"Detailed aftercare instructions and personalized skincare regimen.\",\"image\":\"/images/offers/bridal-package.webp\"}]', 'Every 3 to 4 weeks or as prescribed by consulting dermatologist', '[\"Patients seeking effective, doctor-certified Silver Package.\",\"Individuals with persistent skin or hair concerns requiring medical aesthetic care.\",\"All Indian Fitzpatrick skin types looking for zero or minimal downtime.\"]', '[\"Active open skin lesions or untreated infections in the target area.\",\"Pregnant or breastfeeding patients without prior physician clearance.\"]', '[\"Avoid strong active acids (retinoids, AHA/BHA) 48 hours prior to treatment.\",\"Stay well-hydrated and arrive with a clean face or scalp.\",\"Avoid direct harsh sunbathing or tanning 5 days prior.\"]', '[\"Apply broad-spectrum SPF 50 sunscreen every 3 to 4 hours.\",\"Avoid steam rooms, saunas, and hot baths for 24 to 48 hours.\",\"Keep the treated area well-hydrated with recommended barrier repair cream.\"]', NULL, '[{\"question\":\"How many sessions of Silver Package are recommended?\",\"answer\":\"Most patients see initial improvement after just 1 session. For sustained and optimal clinical results, our dermatologists recommend a personalized protocol of 3 to 6 sessions spaced 3–4 weeks apart.\"},{\"question\":\"Is Silver Package painful or uncomfortable?\",\"answer\":\"Our procedures are designed for maximum comfort. Depending on the modality, topical numbing or advanced cooling mechanisms are utilized to ensure the session is virtually painless.\"},{\"question\":\"Why choose Skinfinity Derma for Silver Package?\",\"answer\":\"At Skinfinity Derma, every single protocol is planned and supervised by certified MD dermatologists using genuine US-FDA approved technology and hospital-grade sanitization.\"}]', 'Silver Package in Noida & Gurgaon | Skinfinity Derma', 'Book Silver Package with Dr. Ipshita Johri at Skinfinity Derma. US-FDA approved technologies, top dermatologists, and customized aesthetic results.', NULL, NULL, 58, 1, 0, '2026-11-01 12:38:35', '2026-11-01 12:38:35', '', 'Silver Package | Skinfinity Derma Clinic', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
